#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:1
#: b7d23c5d4de44f848cfb9fd4585da8d6
msgid "Algorithm Builder quickstart"
msgstr "Algorithm Builder inicio rapido"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:3
#: 76a286721b7a47c1b496f4351d80d311
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:5
#: 1359e942b4f7451ea76ed4f6fb4bc319
msgid ""
"Use a clean checkout, the runtime declared by the repository, and its "
"committed lockfiles. Confirm the active branch before installing anything."
msgstr ""
"Use una copia limpia, el runtime declarado por el repositorio y sus archivos"
" de bloqueo confirmados. Confirme la rama activa antes de instalar nada."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:11
#: e3fcfdab9ef940139507ff13da46e21f
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalar"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:17
#: 3db5e9fdd5ef4f739df36c5d41dc843a
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Comenzar"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:23
#: 8dd237922529410c88d6d590cb05cfaf
msgid ""
"For the side panel, build the unpacked extension and load `dist/extension` "
"in Chromium 114 or later. Missing Auth0 configuration fails closed."
msgstr ""
"For the side panel, build the unpacked extension and load `dist/extension` "
"in Chromium 114 or later. Missing Auth0 configuration fails closed."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:25
#: 2729dd91e2914dc9bb4e80f88c4358fd
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:31
#: 6a64e45025c6403d97bb59d91e60675e
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptacion humana"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:33
#: ea810eba4cc142aaaa105e185a97c931
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione la salida, los registros, los resultados de pruebas y el diff. "
"Acepte, solicite una correccion, ponga en cuarentena o detengase; no "
"promueva silenciosamente un resultado generado."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/quickstart.md:35
#: fc564d8721f548b9b8dd63a71e4fa2b8
msgid ""
"The test suite executes the generated Python locally and compares it with "
"the Builder AST. This is parity evidence, not a substitute for live Colab "
"acceptance."
msgstr ""
"The test suite executes the generated Python locally and compares it with "
"the Builder AST. This is parity evidence, not a substitute for live Colab "
"acceptance."
